  words:
  - odonata
  - odonatas
  info: 'Odonata is an order of predatory flying insects that includes dragonflies
    and damselflies. Members of this order have long bodies and wings, often displaying
    bright metallic colors. Odonata larvae are aquatic, and although adult Odonata
    typically feed only on other insects, the larvae are known to eat small fish
    and tadpoles.


    Source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odonata '
  image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 224f94353ed36c34eabae0ac08401076, type: 3}
